### Requisições FIWARE do WineGuard (REST Client do VS Code / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@orion = http://localhost:1026
@iota = http://localhost:4041
@sth = http://localhost:8666
@service = smart
@servicepath = /
@entity = urn:ngsi-ld:WineSensor:wg001

### Versões
GET {{orion}}/version

###
GET {{iota}}/iot/about

###
GET {{sth}}/version

### Service groups
GET {{iota}}/iot/services
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}

### Dispositivos provisionados
GET {{iota}}/iot/devices
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}

### Entidades (valores atuais)
GET {{orion}}/v2/entities?type=WineSensor&options=keyValues
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}

### Subscriptions
GET {{orion}}/v2/subscriptions
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}

### Comando: LED piscando
PATCH {{orion}}/v2/entities/{{entity}}/attrs?type=WineSensor
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ledOn": { "type": "command", "value": "" } }

### Comando: parar todos os alertas
PATCH {{orion}}/v2/entities/{{entity}}/attrs?type=WineSensor
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "alertStop": { "type": "command", "value": "all" } }

### Histórico raw (últimos 20)
GET {{sth}}/STH/v1/contextEntities/type/WineSensor/id/{{entity}}/attributes/temperature?lastN=20
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}

### Histórico agregado por hora
GET {{sth}}/STH/v1/contextEntities/type/WineSensor/id/{{entity}}/attributes/temperature?aggrMethod=sum&aggrPeriod=hour&dateFrom=2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z&dateTo=2030-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
fiware-service: {{service}}
fiware-servicepath: {{servicepath}}

### Medição via HTTP UltraLight (alternativa ao MQTT, útil para teste sem ESP32)
POST http://localhost:7896/iot/d?k=TEF&i=wg001
Content-Type: text/plain

t|13.5|h|66|l|5|a|none|k|off|d|off|u|42
